- [ ] Users see update within 24 hours

## Example: auto-apply-plugin

[github.com/nitsuah/auto-apply-plugin](https://github.com/nitsuah/auto-apply-plugin) uses this full CI/CD pipeline. Live on Chrome Web Store with 1000+ active users.

## Takeaway

Chrome extensions don't have to be manual or risky. Full CI/CD + testing + API integration = shipping fast with confidence. Every push is a potential release; every release is tested, signed, and automated.

